  <main class="container js-anchorbar-trigger">


  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-sm-12">

      <div class="mod mod-videostage h-fullwidth is-scrolled" data-video-src="https://assets.kuka.com/asset/bf2b6236-ab98-4412-b38c-1510a47bb218/mp4/Swisslog-Brand-ReadyfortheNext-Loop-3-solutions-MODEX-1.mp4" data-video-poster="">
  <div class="js-previewVideo mod-videostage__previewVideo">
    <div class="mod-videostage__previewVideo__dimmer"></div>
    <video poster="/assets-f/img/ab8370d413552c.jpg" preload="metadata" autoplay="" loop="" muted="" playsinline="">
      <source src="/assets-f/media/6235c1d1d7d774.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
  </div>
  <div class="h-fullwidth h-fullwidth--1600 mod-videostage__content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mod-videostage__content__box">
        <div class="box__left">
          <h1 class="h1 h1--bold box__left__headline">Building relationships that maximize the value of automation</h1>
          <div class="box__left__btns">
            <button type="button" class="js-playBtn a-btn a-btn--primary a-btn--color-primary">
              Play full intro video
              <span class="icon-play-32"></span>
            </button>

          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="p1 box__right">
          Swisslog designs, manufactures and optimizes automated logistics solutions across the supply chain, powered by our modular SynQ software platform. With a global team of passionate employees and a portfolio of best-in-class technologies, we partner with customers from solution design through lifecycle.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="mod mod-focusaccordion h-fullwidth h-fullwidth--1760 is-scrolled">


  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="mod-focusaccordion__content">

          <div class="mod-focusaccordion__content__headline">
            <h2>Our industry expertise for your business challenges</h2>
          </div>


          <div class="js-accordion o-accordion mod-focusaccordion__content__accordion">

            <div class="o-accordion__item">

              <button type="button" class="js-itemHeadline o-accordion__item__headline o-accordion__item__headline--toggled">
                Food &amp; beverage
              </button>
              <div class="copy o-accordion__item__content">
                <div class="p2 content__text">
                  <p>Swisslog’s automated warehouse solutions are transforming the food supply chain, addressing challenges from production to point of sale for manufacturers, distributors, and retailers worldwide.</p>
                </div>

                <a href="#" target="" class="a-link--highlight content__href">
                  More
                </a>

                <div class="content__media">


                  <video preload="none" muted="" loop="" playsinline="">
                    <source src="/assets-f/media/373684fcb2549d.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                  </video>

                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <div class="o-accordion__item">

              <button type="button" class="js-itemHeadline o-accordion__item__headline">
                Grocery
              </button>
              <div class="copy o-accordion__item__content">
                <div class="p2 content__text">
                  <p>The future of grocery logistics is intelligent, agile and scalable — a future only made possible by automated distribution networks. Is it time to rethink your fulfillment strategies?</p>
                </div>

                <a href="#" target="" class="a-link--highlight content__href">
                  More
                </a>

                <div class="content__media">


                  <video preload="none" muted="" loop="" playsinline="">
                    <source src="/assets-f/media/05030e711d27ef.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                  </video>

                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <div class="o-accordion__item">

              <button type="button" class="js-itemHeadline o-accordion__item__headline">
                Fashion &amp; apparel
              </button>
              <div class="copy o-accordion__item__content">
                <div class="p2 content__text">
                  <p>What challenges must your fashion and apparel warehouse automation system overcome? From omnichannel fulfillment and returns to seasonal demand, SKU variability, and global inventory flows - only a configurable, scalable solution can meet the complexity of modern apparel logistics.</p>
                </div>

                <a href="#" target="" class="a-link--highlight content__href">
                  More
                </a>

                <div class="content__media">


                  <video preload="none" muted="" loop="" playsinline="">
                    <source src="/assets-f/media/d825829500765c.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                  </video>

                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <div class="o-accordion__item">

              <button type="button" class="js-itemHeadline o-accordion__item__headline">
                General merchandise
              </button>
              <div class="copy o-accordion__item__content">
                <div class="p2 content__text">
                  <p>Customer satisfaction in the dynamic world of general merchandising, relies on quick and accurate order delivery. With flexible automation solutions, we can empower your retail and e-commerce operations with more efficient processes to support your business goals.</p>
                </div>

                <a href="#" target="" class="a-link--highlight content__href">
                  More
                </a>

                <div class="content__media">


                  <video preload="none" muted="" loop="" playsinline="">
                    <source src="/assets-f/media/499d6a7927064b.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                  </video>

                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="mod-focusaccordion__content__allLink">
            <a href="#" target="" class="a-btn a-btn--primary a-btn--color-primary">
              All industries
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
